{"id":"542266e596da4667","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-ideal7-countably-complete-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Ideal7 Countably Complete Ideal","display":"df-zfc-ideal7-countably-complete-ideal — ZFC Ideal7 Countably Complete Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal7-countably-complete-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal7-countably-complete-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal7-countably-complete-ideal — ZFC Ideal7 Countably Complete Ideal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal7-countably-complete-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal7-countably-complete-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal7-countably-complete-ideal — ZFC Ideal7 Countably Complete Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal I\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal I\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\)</span> (set-ideal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7CountablyCompleteIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7CountablyCompleteIdeal}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}countably\\text{-}complete\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7CountablyCompleteIdeal}_S(X,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\forall\\vec A\\in\\mathcal I^\\omega\\;(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec A(n)\\in\\mathcal I)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}countably\\text{-}complete\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7CountablyCompleteIdeal}_S(X,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\forall\\vec A\\in\\mathcal I^\\omega\\;(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec A(n)\\in\\mathcal I)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Countable completeness is expressed directly by closure under unions of all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-sequences in the ideal; the sequence variable is assertion-bound and no generic completeness predicate is needed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ideal}$ (set-ideal predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7CountablyCompleteIdeal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}countably\\text{-}complete\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7CountablyCompleteIdeal}_S(X,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\forall\\vec A\\in\\mathcal I^\\omega\\;(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec A(n)\\in\\mathcal I)","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1114,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2302","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-ideal7-countably-complete-ideal.md|58-df-zfc-ideal7-countably-complete-ideal]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","6e4f95381faac4f9"]}